1. Quickstart, cli flow:

This workstation is created with prebuilt aaos-sdv and aaos-ivi images.
To launch both:
```bash
launch_2vm
```

Next, install and launch carla simulator and someip-bridge, to feed car signals to aaos:
```bash
launch_carla
```
NOTE: some demo environments do not come with Carla simulator pre-installed. To install:
```bash
install_carla
```

Carla controls:
(`?` in pygame window to see all hotkeys. `p` to toggle autopilot, `WASD` to drive)
(if autopilot gets stuck, `backspace` to unblock)

Observe ivi and instrument cluster in browser:
```bash
visualize_cvd
```

2. Develop with Android Studio for Platform:

```bash
asfp
```

3. Develop with Antigravity

```bash
antigravity-cli
```
